  "summaries": [
    {
      "id": 397494,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "In this report, the researcher reported an exposure of CDN access token that allows an attacker to modify newly uploaded photo in GTA5 Snapmatics. The access token retained validity for a brief interval subsequent to the upload process, thereby providing a window of opportunity for content modification.\nThis issue has been resolved by removing CDN fields from the response.",
